            "paragraph": "This research addresses this gap by using historical rainfall records (1980\u20132017) and GCM data from the Canadian Earth System Model (CanESM2) under Representative Concentration Pathways (RCP) 4.5 [12] and 8.5 [13] to project future scenarios.",
