            "target_entity_instance": "Bangladesh",
            "target_entity_type": "Country",
            "paragraph": "Monsoon intensity: Traditionally, Q3 (the monsoon season) had an Rx5day value of 260.9 mm. Indeed, future projection indicate this is set to continue, as evidenced by observation in Bangladesh, where downscaled data for CanESM2 reveals despite possible changes to overall levels of rainfall, the peak value for multi-day events remains an ever-present flood threat factor [29].",
